:: Skyscraper Whitney Confront
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"That was dangerous," you say, unable to keep the tremble from your voice. "I could've been hurt. You didn't even look at me. It was all about the car."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Are you insane?" you snap. "You nearly got me killed chasing that idiot, and the only thing you cared about was your stupid car."
<<else>>
	"You could have gotten me killed back there," you say, meeting <<his>> eyes. "And the whole time, all you were thinking about was the car."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
	Something behind Avery's eyes goes cold. "Say that again."
	<<set $averyragerevealed to 1>>
	You've seen this look before. You don't get the chance to take it back.
	<br><br>

	Avery's hand closes in your hair.
	<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
		<<He>> moves to drive a knee into your <<bellyDescription "pc">>, prompting you to instinctively curl around it. <<He>> takes the opening and strikes you across the face instead.
	<<else>>
		<<He>> slams you back against the ruined car, knocking the breath from you, and strikes you across the face.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> spits on you, then hauls you upright by the collar.<<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>><<gggpain>><<trauma 12>><<stress 12>><<pain 12>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>>
	<br><br>

	"You don't question me," <<he>> says, the fury already cooling into something colder. "Ever. Get inside before I lose my patience entirely."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 40 and C.npc.Avery.love gt C.npc.Avery.rage>>
	Avery's expression softens at once.
	<br><br>
	"Oh, <<pcpetname "Avery">>." <<He>> reaches out and cups your cheek. "Come here. I'm sorry. Your <<nnpc_mummy "Avery">> just got a little carried away." <<His>> thumb strokes beneath your eye. "I would never let anything happen to you. I was watching you the whole time. You know that, don't you?"
	<br><br>

	The worst of it is, some part of you wants to believe <<him>>.<<ltrauma>><<trauma -6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.rage gte 25>>
	Avery's smile thins.
	<br><br>

	"Killed?" <<He>> gives a short, humourless laugh. "You threw yourself around like a rag doll, and now you want to blame me? If you'd kept your head you wouldn't have a scratch. Whitney's little friends managed it." <<His>> voice cools. "Next time, try not to embarrass me."
	<br><br>

	You know better than to argue.<<gstress>><<gtrauma>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Avery isn't really listening. "Mm. It all worked out, didn't it?" <<He>> pats the ruined bonnet as though it were a loyal hound. "Mostly. Do stop fretting."
	<br><br>
	<<He>> turns for the mansion without a backward glance, already muttering about which panel <<he>> needs to replace.
	<br><br>

	<<if $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		You're left standing in the drive, seething.
	<<else>>
		You're left standing in the drive, forgotten.
	<</if>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Whitney Confront
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_garden">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<set $avery_mansion.whitney_confront to false>>
<<avery_mansion_seen>>
<<person1>>

Avery carries on as though nothing happened, as though <<he>> didn't leave you thrashing in the harbour while <<his>> car sank beside you. You can't let it go.
<br><br>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"You left me in the water," you say quietly. "Whitney's friends pulled me out. Not you. You didn't even look."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"You left me to drown," you say. "I had to be dragged out by Whitney, of all people, while you fussed over your dented toy."
<<else>>
	"You left me in the water at the docks," you say, holding <<his>> gaze. "Whitney got me out. You were too busy with your car to notice I was gone."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
	The warmth drains from Avery's face. "Careful," <<he>> says softly. "You've been home five minutes, and already you're accusing me."
	<<set $averyragerevealed to 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<He>> seizes your jaw, forcing you to meet <<his>> eyes.
	<<if $avery_mansion.jobs and $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("dungeon")>>
		"I think you've forgotten your place. Let me remind you." <<He>> turns you towards the study, <<his>> grip like iron.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<garage>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Mansion Dungeon Intro 2]]>><<set $bus to "avery_dungeon">><<set $phase to 1>><<unset $sexstart>><<unset $fightstart>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
			<<He>> raises a hand as though to strike, then thinks better of aiming at your <<bellyDescription "pc">> and slaps you hard across the face instead.
		<<else>>
			<<He>> strikes you across the face, hard enough to send you stumbling.
		<</if>>
		<<He>> spits at your feet. "You'll learn to hold your tongue."<<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>><<gggpain>><<trauma 12>><<stress 12>><<pain 12>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<garage>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 40 and C.npc.Avery.love gt C.npc.Avery.rage>>
	Avery's face falls. "Is that what you think?"
	<br><br>
	<<He>> crosses to you and takes your hands in <<his>>. "<<pcpetname "Avery">>, no. I knew you could swim. I knew you'd find your way home to me, you always do." <<His>> thumbs stroke your knuckles. "But you're right. I should have come for you first. Forgive your <<nnpc_mummy "Avery">>. It won't happen again."
	<br><br>

	It's a practised sort of tenderness, and you hate how much you want it to be real.<<ltrauma>><<trauma -6>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.rage gte 25>>
	Avery's expression hardens.
	<br><br>
	"You ran off with Whitney's little gang," <<he>> says. "You made your choice the moment you stayed in that seat and let go of my hand. If you'd drowned, that would have been your own doing." <<His>> voice is ice. "Don't come crying to me about consequences you invited."
	<br><br>

	You know better than to push it.<<gstress>><<gtrauma>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Avery arches an eyebrow. "You're here, aren't you? Dry, warm, and whole." <<He>> turns towards the house. "I fail to see the tragedy. Do try to keep up next time."
	<br><br>
	And that, as far as <<hes>> concerned, is the end of it.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Garden Crops Intro
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_garden">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Avery>><<person1>>
You find Avery standing among the flowerbeds, <<his>> hands clasped behind <<his>> back.
<<He>> watches a bee drift from bloom to bloom, lost in thought, and doesn't notice you at first.
<br><br>
When <<he>> does, <<he>> straightens, and the distant look gives way to a careful smile.
"<<pcpetname "Avery">>," <<he>> says. "I didn't hear you."
<br><br>
<<He>> turns back to the garden. "I've been spending more time out here lately. Strange, isn't it?
I never used to. There was always something more pressing." <<He>> frowns.
"Funny, how that changes, when you nearly don't get the chance to do anything at all."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden Crops Intro 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Garden Crops Intro 2
<<effects>>
Avery falls quiet. You recognise the look on <<his>> face. <<He>> is grateful, though too proud to say it properly.
You pulled <<him>> back from the edge, and <<he>> has never been good at admitting when <<he>> needed help.
<br><br>
"You saved me," <<he>> says at last, not quite meeting your eyes. "I don't think I've properly thanked you for that.
I'm not... entirely certain I know how." <<He>> exhales, and when <<he>> faces you again the smile is real, if a little pained.
<br><br>
"So let me try it like this." <<He>> gestures to a sheltered corner of the garden,
where glass panes catch the light over a stretch of unworked soil. "It's yours, if you'd like it.
Grow whatever you please. I'll have no one lay a finger on it but you.
Consider it a place of your own. Here. With me."
<br><br>
<<link [[Accept|Mansion Garden Crops Accept]]>><<set $avery_mansion.crops to 1>><<set $monthly.averyGardenPlot to true>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><</link>><<glove>><<larage>>
<br>
<<link [[Decline|Mansion Garden Crops Decline]]>><<set $avery_mansion.crops to 1>><<set $monthly.averyGardenPlot to true>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Garden Crops Accept
<<effects>>
You tell Avery you'd love nothing more.
<br><br>
"Good," <<he>> says softly. Something in <<his>> shoulders loosens. "Good."
<<He>> clears <<his>> throat and recovers <<his>> usual poise. "I'll have seeds and tools brought down.
The glass will keep it warm enough to grow all year round.
I won't have your efforts ruined by something as common as the weather."
<br><br>
<<He>> lingers a moment longer than necessary, then leans in and presses a kiss to your forehead.
"Enjoy it, <<pcpetname "Avery">>. Truly."
<br><br>
With that, <<he>> heads back towards the house, leaving you alone with your new patch of earth.
<br><br>
<span class="gold">You can now grow your own crops in Avery's garden, sheltered beneath glass so they thrive in any season.</span>
<br>
<<gardenicon "flower">><<link [[Tend the soil|Mansion Garden Plots]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Garden Crops Decline
<<effects>>
You thank Avery, but tell <<him>> you couldn't possibly.
<br><br>
<<He>> only smiles and shakes <<his>> head. "It's already done, <<pcpetname "Avery">>.
The soil is turned, the glass is up. I'll not have it pulled apart again." <<His>> voice softens.
"Use it or don't, as you please. It isn't going anywhere."
<br><br>
For a moment, <<he>> looks relieved, or perhaps disappointed, before quickly hiding it.
"I'll be inside."
<br><br>
<span class="gold">The patch is yours whenever you want it, sheltered beneath glass so it can be worked in any season.</span>
<br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Garden Whine
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_garden">><<set $outside to 1>><<effects>>
<<endevent>>
<<npc Avery>><<person1>>
You crouch by the plot, frowning at the state of it. Half the beds have dried out again, and there's nowhere left to put anything new.
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek" or $speech_attitude_avery>>
	"Um... Avery?" you say, not quite looking up. "The plot's a bit small. And I can't always get to everything before it dries out."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"This is pathetic," you announce, not bothering to look up. "Half of it's dried to dust and there's no room for anything else. Fix it."
<<else>>
	"Avery," you say, straightening up. "The plot's too small, and I can't keep on top of the watering. It needs sorting."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte 60>>
	Avery's jaw tightens, and for a moment you think you've misjudged it. But <<he>> only exhales through <<his>> nose.
	<br><br>
	"Is that so? Very well. I'll have it seen to. Try to sound grateful next time."
	<<He>> turns away before you can answer.<<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<larage>>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.love gte 40 and C.npc.Avery.love gt C.npc.Avery.rage>>
	Avery's whole face softens, and <<he>> crosses to crouch beside you, inspecting the dry soil for <<himself>>.
	<br><br>
	"Oh, <<pcpetname "Avery">>, why didn't you say something sooner?" <<He>> brushes the dirt from your fingers and takes your hand instead.
	"Leave it with me. I'll have it properly sorted. You deserve better than this."<<npcincr Avery love 1>><<glove>>
<<elseif C.npc.Avery.rage gte 25>>
	Avery glances over, unimpressed, but doesn't argue.
	<br><br>
	"Fine," <<he>> says, brushing off <<his>> hands. "I'll get someone on it. Try not to let the rest die in the meantime."
<<else>>
	Avery looks over, mildly surprised to be addressed at all.
	<br><br>
	"Hmmn. Fair enough," <<he>> says, considering the cramped little plot. "I'll have it expanded. Shouldn't take long."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $avery_mansion.crops_upgrade to 1>><<set $weekly.averyGardenUpgrade to true>>
<span class="gold">Avery will have the garden sorted out within the week.</span>
<br>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Garden]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Mansion Garden Plots
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_garden">><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<plot_effects>>
<<if !$plots["avery_mansion"]>>
	<<plots_init avery_mansion 3 earth 3 medium>>
<</if>>
<<if $avery_mansion.crops_upgrade is 1 and !$weekly.averyGardenUpgrade>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.crops_upgrade to 3>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.greenhouse to true>>
	<<add_plot avery_mansion earth 3 medium>>
	<<add_plot avery_mansion earth 3 medium>>
	<<add_plot avery_mansion earth 3 medium>>
	True to <<his>> word, Avery's had the plot seen to. The bed's been widened, fresh soil turned into three new rows,
	and a narrow pipe now runs along the back wall, dripping into the earth below.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
You step into the glass-walled corner of the garden Avery set aside for you.
The air is warm and light pools across the soil. <span class="gold">Plants can be grown here at any time of year.</span>
<br><br>
<<display_plot avery_mansion>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Mansion Garden]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Mansion Bedroom Masturbate
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_bedroom">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<getTarget true>><<set _enableSexToys to true>>

<<if $avery_mansion is undefined>><<set $avery_mansion to {}>><</if>>
<<if $avery_mansion.masturbate is undefined>><<set $avery_mansion.masturbate to {}>><</if>>

/* Avery home check (schedule) */
<<set _sched to ($avery_mansion.schedule || "away")>>
<<set _awayStates to ["away","work","date","return"]>>
<<set _averyHome to (!_awayStates.includes(_sched))>>

<<if $masturbationstart is 1>>
	<<unset $masturbationstart>>
	<<if $masturbationstat is undefined or isNaN($masturbationstat)>>
		<<set $masturbationstat to 0>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $masturbationstat += 1>>
	<<masturbationstart>>
	You sink into the plush mattress, its velvet softness swallowing you whole, every contour designed to cradle and indulge; you feel giddy as your hands roam all over your body.
	<br><br>
	/* Start a simple timer only if Avery is home */
	<<if _averyHome>>
		<<set $timerMax to (_sched is "sleep" ? 60 : 40)>>
		<<set $timer to $timerMax>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.active to true>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.timer to $timer>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.timerMax to $timerMax>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.active to false>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.timer to 0>>
		<<unset $avery_mansion.masturbate.timerMax>>
		<<unset $timer>>
		<<unset $timerMax>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

/* Restore session timer state if the passage is re-entered through history or refresh. */
<<if _averyHome and $avery_mansion.masturbate.active>>
	<<if $timer is undefined and $avery_mansion.masturbate.timer isnot undefined>>
		<<set $timer to $avery_mansion.masturbate.timer>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $timerMax is undefined and $avery_mansion.masturbate.timerMax isnot undefined>>
		<<set $timerMax to $avery_mansion.masturbate.timerMax>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

/* If Avery is home and the caution meter is full, resolve the caught event inline. */
<<if _averyHome and $timer isnot undefined and $timer lte 0>>
	<<include "Mansion Bedroom Masturbate Caught">>
<<else>>
	/* Text + Caution UI */
	<<if !_averyHome>>
		You have the bedroom to yourself.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<set _max to ($timerMax || 40)>>
		<<set _t to ($timer || _max)>>
		<<set _caution to Math.round(100 - ((_t / _max) * 100))>>
		<<set _caution to Math.min(100, Math.max(0, _caution))>>
		You try to keep quiet, as Avery is somewhere in the mansion.
		<br><br>
		Caution: <<print _caution>>%
		<div class="meter">
			<<print '<div class="redbar" style="width:' + _caution + '%"></div>'>>
		</div>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<masturbationeffects>><<masturbationactions>>
	<<if _averyHome>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.timer to ($timer is undefined ? 0 : $timer)>>
		<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.timerMax to ($timerMax is undefined ? 0 : $timerMax)>>
		<<masturbationControls "timer">>
	<<else>>
		<<masturbationControls>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Bedroom Masturbate Finish
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<set $bus to "avery_bedroom">><<set $avery_passage to $passage>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<effects>><<avery_mansion>>
<<set _awayStates to ["away","work","date","return"]>>
