	<<if C.npc.Avery.rage gte random(20, 100) and $averyragerevealed gte 1>>
		<<He>> scoffs, gathers <<himself>> up, and punches the lamp on <<his>> bedside cabinet in frustration.
	<<else>>
		Avery scoffs and pointedly refuses to look at you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>>you tremble, but you force yourself to hold it together as you try to settle back down.
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
<<unset $sexstart>><<unset $fightstart>><<unset $finish>><<unset $timer>><<unset $timerMax>>
<<if $avery_mansion and $avery_mansion.masturbate>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.active to false>>
	<<set $avery_mansion.masturbate.timer to 0>>
	<<unset $avery_mansion.masturbate.finish>>
	<<unset $avery_mansion.masturbate.timerMax>>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Mansion Bedroom]]>><</link>>


:: Mansion Masturbate Fight
<<if $fightstart is 1>>
	<<unset $fightstart>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	<<set $enemytrust -= 100>>
	<<set $enemyanger += 200>>
	<<npcidlegenitals>>
<</if>>
<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mansion Masturbate Fight Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Mansion Masturbate Fight]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Mansion Masturbate Fight Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	Out of strength, Avery collapses. <<tearful>> you use the opportunity to escape from arm's reach.<<larage>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<His>> knees tremble as <<he>> climbs to <<his>> feet. <<He>> glares at you a moment, then walks away.
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	Avery's knees buckle, and <<he>> collapses in a heap. <<tearful>> you use the opportunity to escape from arm's reach.<<larage>><<npcincr Avery rage -1>><<ldom>><<npcincr Avery dom -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you recover.
<<else>>
	You fall to the ground, too hurt to continue fighting. Avery observes you a moment, considering, then <<he>> walks away.<<ggdom>><<npcincr Avery dom 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you struggle to your feet.
<</if>>
<<endcombat>><<clotheson>>
<<unset $sexstart>><<unset $fightstart>><<unset $finish>><<unset $timer>><<unset $timerMax>>
